"""
Rainbow HAT 3-bit binary counter with touchpads, 14-segment display,
APA102 LED strip, and buzzer.

Touchpad A (GPIO5)  -> MSB (value 4)
Touchpad B (GPIO6)  -> middle bit (value 2)
Touchpad C (GPIO12) -> LSB (value 1)
"""

